{"title":"Tougen Anki","synopsis":"Ichinose Shiki, pewaris darah Oni telah menjalani seluruh masa kecilnya tanpa menyadari fakta ini. Namun, ketika seorang pria tak dikenal datang bergegas ke rumahnya dalam upaya untuk membunuhnya, ayah angkatnya akhirnya mengungkapkan kebenarannya. Di dunia di mana Oni dan Momotarou tidak pernah bisa hidup berdampingan, bergabunglah dengan Ichinose dalam perjuangannya untuk mendapatkan kekuasaan dan mempersatukan dua ras!","alternative_title":"桃源暗鬼, Tougen Anki: Legend of the Cursed Blood, Tôgen Anki : La légende du sang maudit","author":"Urushibara Yura","artist":"Urushibara Yura","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"45736b71-4cc5-48d9-a9b4-dae3cfce71a3","number":"241","title":"Chapter 241","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"id":"08276964-3549-448b-8305-da99cfa2c624","number":"240","title":"Chapter 240","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"id":"61156f75-af22-44a6-8f8e-0f2ef1009e34","number":"239","title":"Chapter 239","date":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"id":"389f9cb5-117a-43bf-9479-89b3976efef6","number":"238","title":"Chapter 238","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"id":"78ba2c5c-3a70-4f6f-8fc9-9b2503e184a7","number":"237","title":"Chapter 237","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"1bb2f74a-9d86-455b-a1cc-17cbe38c49b9","number":"236","title":"Chapter 236","date":"2026-05-16","images":[]},{"id":"a876f6f6-302b-454b-9a2e-1c64ac8d98b0","number":"235","title":"Chapter 235","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"04e33b17-2c75-4346-b7be-3ae552f42362","number":"234","title":"Chapter 234","date":"2026-04-20","images":[]},{"id":"5d9edb4d-ce51-4a8c-a2bf-d94fca872f64","number":"233","title":"Chapter 233","date":"2026-04-16","images":[]},{"id":"3f268988-1dd3-4ab4-8f51-d41c92645317","number":"232","title":"Chapter 232","date":"2026-04-08","images":[]},{"id":"c8f4c4fd-dbdd-4fa1-8983-e919fc81db39","number":"231","title":"Chapter 231","date":"2026-03-13","images":[]},{"id":"96bc4ae5-938c-4742-98e1-78d30adff032","number":"230","